// flip: no
// Spreading after an object with an index signature keeps only the index signatures both sides have (tsc's
// getSpreadType: getUnionIndexInfos). A union member undefined of what is spread second merges like an object without
// any (`{}` here, which then subtype-reduces the literal's union on widening), and so does `{}` of `{} | undefined`
// (tryMergeUnionOfObjectTypeAndEmptyObject returns the empty object). tttt kept `{ [x: string]: string | null }`.
